{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-electricity-support-comparator UI copy.details","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details","keys":["norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details"],"locale":"zh-TW","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"標準家庭支援支付每小時超過NOK ZXQPH0001QXZ/kWh的現貨價格金額的ZXQPH0000QXZ,不含增值稅,每月合格使用量不超過ZXQPH0002QXZ kWh。 Norgespris使用固定的參考價格NOK ZXQPH0003QXZ/kWh,包括增值稅(NOK ZXQPH0004QXZ不含電力增值稅 ) ; 其結算使用全月的面積平均現貨價格和合格計量使用量。 住宅的上限為ZXQPH0005QXZ kWh/月,度假屋為ZXQPH0006QXZ kWh/月。","record_id":"486ca199a19df80a1ba2efe9870491467a0ee2b4bad435625403514b4b725208","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.3823815452499844,"source":"The standard household support pays 90% of each hourly spot-price amount above NOK 0.77/kWh before VAT, for eligible use up to 5,000 kWh per month. Norgespris uses a fixed reference price of NOK 0.50/kWh including VAT (NOK 0.40 without electricity VAT); its settlement uses the full month’s area-average spot price and eligible metered use. The cap is 5,000 kWh/month for a home or 1,000 kWh/month for a holiday home. A household can choose one scheme, not both. Network charges and other fees are entered separately and added to all scenarios. The comparison uses the exact hourly data you provide; it does not fetch prices.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"d11756b16900fc77b690175c893987cc42885b2968d7f203c6f3ed31fa208db2","status":"machine-draft","translation":"標準家庭支援支付每小時超過NOK 0.77/kWh的現貨價格金額的90%,不含增值稅,每月合格使用量不超過5,000 kWh。 Norgespris使用固定的參考價格NOK 0.50/kWh,包括增值稅(NOK 0.40不含電力增值稅 ) ; 其結算使用全月的面積平均現貨價格和合格計量使用量。 住宅的上限為5,000 kWh/月,度假屋為1,000 kWh/月。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
